      "writtenOn": "2026-08-10T09:38:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could we re-check Dimm type mappings against PDI? This block currently uses string for many fields, but PDI defines mixed types (for example uint16 / size / enum / array[uint16], such as MemoryDataWidth, MaxMemorySpeedInMhz, ECC, AllowedSpeedsMT). It would be good to keep schema types aligned with the interface contract.",
      "revId": "856cdfc90ae8886096a1af73e46d30717957f4b9",
